          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Expression of Individual Genes Can Be Measured Using Quantitative RT-PCR 536  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Global Analysis of mRNAs by RNA-seq Provides a Snapshot of Gene Expression 536  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Genome-wide Chromatin Immunoprecipitation Identifies Sites on the Genome Occupied by Transcription Regulators 538  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Ribosome Profiling Reveals Which mRNAs Are Being Translated in the Cell 538  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Recombinant DNA Methods Have Revolutionized Human Health 539  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Transgenic Plants Are Important for Agriculture 540  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Summary 542  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "MATHEMATICAL ANALYSIS OF CELL FUNCTION 542  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Regulatory Networks Depend on Molecular Interactions 543  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Differential Equations Help Us Predict Transient Behavior 545  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Promoter Activity and Protein Degradation Affect the Rate of Change of Protein Concentration 546  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "The Time Required to Reach Steady State Depends on Protein Lifetime 547  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Quantitative Methods Are Similar for Transcription Repressors and Activators 548  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Negative Feedback Is a Powerful Strategy in Cell Regulation 549  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Delayed Negative Feedback Can Induce Oscillations 549  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "DNA Binding by a Repressor or an Activator Can Be Cooperative 551  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Positive Feedback Is Important for Switchlike Responses and Bistability 551  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Robustness Is an Important Characteristic of Biological Networks 553  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Two Transcription Regulators That Bind to the Same Gene Promoter Can Exert Combinatorial Control 554  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "An Incoherent Feed-forward Interaction Generates Pulses 555  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "A Coherent Feed-forward Interaction Detects Persistent Inputs 556  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "The Same Network Can Behave Differently in Different Cells Because of Stochastic Effects 557  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Several Computational Approaches Can Be Used to Model the Reactions in Cells 557  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Statistical Methods Are Critical for the Analysis of Biological Data 558  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Summary 558  "
                }
